{
  "id": "6a64008e5126fd3d1d089793",
  "title": "脳みそにはギアがある",
  "created": 1784938642,
  "updated": 1784948274,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a64008e5126fd3d1d089793",
      "text": "脳みそにはギアがある",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938642,
      "updated": 1784938643
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400930000000000c47fc2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938643,
      "updated": 1784938643
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400930000000000c47fc3",
      "text": "ほぼ #二重過程理論 ",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938644,
      "updated": 1784938654
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400940000000000c47fc4",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938644,
      "updated": 1784938644
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64009f0000000000c47fc5",
      "text": "　思考は二種類あって（いや二種類も便宜上の定義であって本当はもっと細かいかもしれない）",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938656,
      "updated": 1784938697
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400b60000000000c47fc7",
      "text": "　　[トルク]の重さを変えることができる",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784938679,
      "updated": 1784948274
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400c60000000000c47fc8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938694,
      "updated": 1784938694
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400c60000000000c47fc9",
      "text": "　重いと時間がかかるが、質が高い",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938694,
      "updated": 1784938709
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400d60000000000c47fca",
      "text": "　　軽いと質が悪いが早い",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938710,
      "updated": 1784938719
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400a10000000000c47fc6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938657,
      "updated": 1784938657
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400e70000000000c47fcb",
      "text": "　頭がいい悪いはこのトルクの重さに影響していることが多い",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938727,
      "updated": 1784938750
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400fe0000000000c47fcd",
      "text": "　　頭が悪そうに見える言動はトルクが軽い可能性がある",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938751,
      "updated": 1784938764
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64010c0000000000c47fce",
      "text": "　　　が結果的に軽い方が最適な時もある。",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938765,
      "updated": 1784938776
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6400e80000000000c47fcc",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1784938728,
      "updated": 1784938728
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64204000000000002de17e",
      "text": "関連しそうな表現：[思考を車に例える] - [思考のギアチェンジ] - [思考のオーバードライブ]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784946753,
      "updated": 1784948230
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6425f900000000006ab84e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1784948218,
      "updated": 1784948218
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64204300000000002de17f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1784946755,
      "updated": 1784946755
    }
  ]
}